        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    equity_value = 2_000_000\n    debt_value = 1_000_000\n    equity_cost = 0.08\n    after_tax_debt_cost = 0.04\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    total_value = equity_value + debt_value\n    equity_weight = equity_value / total_value\n    debt_weight = debt_value / total_value\n\n    wacc = (equity_weight * equity_cost) + (debt_weight * after_tax_debt_cost)\n    answer = round(wacc * 100, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
